              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rundi pa Ahazia pier ario wi ario kinde m’emaku camu ker; e ecamu ker rundi acel i Yerusalem. Man nying’ min en e Athalia ma nyar Omri m’ubimo mir Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.26",
