              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man gicidho giku Yoram ma wod Ahab nikiedo kum Hazael m’ubimo mi Cami i Ramoth-gilead: e Jucami gitong’o lero kum Yoram. ",
          "type": "text",
